.TH ferry-name 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-name \- Show or change the name of this device visible to others
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry name\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or change the name of this device visible to others
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
New device name
